- Integrate third-party REST APIs into a web application.
- Make HTTP requests using Axios.
- Understand and process JSON API responses.
- Dynamically generate HTML using EJS templates.
- Iterate through arrays and nested JavaScript objects.
- Implement conditional rendering and error messages.
- Maintain user-selected form values.
- Build flexible webpage layouts using CSS Flexbox.
- Connect server-side application logic with front-end presentation.

